      font-size="16px" font-weight="bold">08.042 Mixed Cushion with Cut Corners</text>
<text font-family="sans-serif" font-size="14px" fill="black" x="230" y="248">Carroll, Jerry W; Angles, Aug 92, p5</text>
<text font-family="sans-serif" font-size="14px" fill="black" x="230" y="266">Diagrams for Corundum and CZ are similar but not TR</text>
<text font-family="sans-serif" font-size="14px" fill="black" x="230" y="284">variations.  Angles are rounded to convenient degrees.</text>
<text font-family="sans-serif" font-size="14px" fill="black"><tspan x="230" y="302">Angles for R.I. = 1.540</tspan>
<tspan x="230" y="320">101 facets + 24 girdles</tspan>
<tspan x="230" y="338">2-fold, mirror-image symmetry; 96 index</tspan>
<tspan x="230" y="356">L/W = 1.333  T/W = 0.785  U/W = 0.455</tspan>
<tspan x="230" y="374">P/W = 0.596 C/W = 0.192</tspan>
<tspan x="230" y="392">Vol/W&#179; = 0.474</tspan>
<tspan x="230" y="410">pc08042.asc</tspan>
